# Birthing Ritual's "you may sacrifice a creature" with no creature that can be sacrificed: March of the Machines makes Hithlain
# Rope a 2/2 artifact creature, Bot1's only creature, so the Ritual triggers at the end step ("if you control a creature"),
# looks at the top seven, but offers no sacrifice (CR 101.2: a creature that can't be sacrificed is none to sacrifice):
# nothing is asked, the Rope stays, and nothing enters.

